DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250331
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250401
SUMMARY:Eclipse Temurin 23 reached end of availability
DESCRIPTION:What happens: End of availability since March 2025 on the Eclip
 se Temurin support page: no more Temurin updates for Java 23.\nWho: Projec
 ts whose Java is Eclipse Temurin 23 (actions/setup-java with distribution 
 temurin\, a Gradle toolchain with vendor ADOPTIUM\, a temurin .java-versio
 n\, or an eclipse-temurin Docker image)\nDate precision: Mar 2025\nLast ve
 rified 2026-11-28
